## 🧩 State Management

The system maintains state across the autonomous loop.

Each iteration stores information such as:

```text
Score
Critique
Draft
Improvement Delta
```

The running history allows the dashboard to display the complete evolution of the task.

The state flow is:

```text
Current Draft
     ↓
Evaluator
     ↓
Evaluation
     ↓
Critic
     ↓
Critique
     ↓
Improver
     ↓
Improved Draft
     ↓
Next Evaluation
```

The next evaluation receives the latest draft, while the improvement agent receives the previous evaluation and critique.

This allows the system to maintain context between iterations.

